@startuml CodeArena_Deployment_Diagram
title CodeArena Deployment Diagram

skinparam backgroundColor #FAFBFC
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #374151
skinparam DefaultFontName Arial
skinparam DefaultTextAlignment center
skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor #F3F4F6
  BorderColor #374151
}
skinparam artifact {
  BackgroundColor #FEF3C7
  BorderColor #92400E
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #DCFCE7
  BorderColor #166534
}

left to right direction

actor "Coder / Admin" as User

node "User Workstation\n<<device>>" as Workstation {
  node "Java 17 Runtime + JavaFX 21\n<<executionEnvironment>>" as JavaRuntime {
    artifact "codearena-1.0-SNAPSHOT.jar\n<<artifact>>" as App

    component "JavaFX UI\nMainApp + ScreenFactory" as UI
    component "Service Layer\nAuth, Problems, Battles,\nProfile, Admin, Judge" as Services
    component "DAO Layer\nUserDAO, ProblemDAO,\nSubmissionDAO, TestCaseDAO" as DAO
    component "Local Judge\nJudgeService + JudgeEngine" as Judge
    artifact "Packaged Resources\nschema.sql, seed.sql,\nimages/badges/logos" as Resources
  }

  database "SQLite Database File\n<<artifact>>\ndata/codearena.db" as SQLite

  node "OS Temp Sandbox\n<<executionEnvironment>>\n%TEMP%/codearena/{submissionId}" as Sandbox {
    artifact "Submitted Source\nSolution.java / solution.py" as Source
    artifact "Compiled Output\nSolution.class" as ClassFile
  }

  node "Local Toolchain on PATH\n<<executionEnvironment>>" as Toolchain {
    artifact "javac" as Javac
    artifact "java" as JavaCmd
    artifact "python / python3 / py -3\n(optional)" as Python
  }
}

User --> UI : keyboard / mouse
UI --> Services : screen actions
Services --> DAO : business requests
DAO --> SQLite : JDBC / SQLite

App --> Resources : loads bundled files
Resources --> SQLite : create schema + seed data\non first launch

Services --> Judge : run samples / submit solution
Judge --> DAO : load test cases\nsave submissions
Judge --> Sandbox : write temp source\ncleanup after run
Judge --> Toolchain : ProcessBuilder\ncompile/run
Javac --> Source : compiles Java source
Javac --> ClassFile : creates
JavaCmd --> ClassFile : executes Java submission
Python --> Source : py_compile / execute Python
Toolchain --> Judge : stdout, stderr,\nexit code, timeout

note bottom of Workstation
CodeArena deploys as a local desktop application.
There is no web frontend, REST API, remote server, or network database.
end note

@enduml
